      "text": "Reuben, thou art my firstborn, my might, Gen. 49:3. love the Lord thy God … with all thy soul, and with all thy might, Deut. 6:5 (Moro. 10:32; D&C 4:2; 59:5). might of mine hand hath gotten me this wealth, Deut. 8:17. there shall be no might in thine hand, Deut. 28:32. Go in this thy might, and thou shalt save Israel, Judg. 6:14. hand findeth to do, do it with thy might, Eccl. 9:10. neither let the mighty man glory in his might, Jer. 9:23. Blessed be the name of God … for wisdom and might are his, Dan. 2:20. Not by might, nor by power, but by my spirit, Zech. 4:6.",
